<main>
  <div class="card hero-card">
    <div class="hero-icon"><i data-lucide="compass"></i></div>
    <h1>Accrediation Compass</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Competency tracking and CAHME accreditation reporting for the Health Management and Policy Department MHA and HEMBA programs.</p>
    <p class="hero-desc">Accrediation Compass replaces manual spreadsheets with a centralized system where faculty submit course assessment data and administrators track accreditation readiness in real time.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <div class="steps-row">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>1. Faculty submit course data</strong>
          <p>Select your course, upload your syllabus and rubric, and enter teaching and assessment method details.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>Download and complete the score template</strong>
          <p>A CSV template is generated with your course's primary competencies. Enter student scores and upload it back.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>Administrators review the dashboard</strong>
          <p>Track submission status, view competency score trends, and identify gaps before accreditation reporting.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>